    "Message" : {
      "En" : "Mysree, bathed in sunlight, has a\r\ncertain magickal quality, making it an\r\nideal motif for us musicians. What further\r\nstimulates the senses is the so-called\r\n\"Ancient Ritual Ground\"—its beautifully\r\ndilapidated appearance is almost sensual.\r\nMonsters might be drawn to its charm as well.",
      "Jp" : "陽光あふれるミスリウは、どこか幻想的で\r\n我ら音楽家にとっても格好のモチーフです\r\nさらに感性を刺激するのは、誰が名付けたか\r\n「古の祭祀場」――美しく朽ちたそのたたずまいは\r\n官能さえ感じます\r\n魔物たちも、魅せられて集まるのかも知れません"
